==German==

===Etymology===
Compound of {{m|de|Kacke||[[caca]], [[crap]]}} or {{compound|de|kacken|t1=to [[crap]], to [[shit]]|Wurst|t2=[[sausage]]}}.  From the similarity of feces with sausage (in form).

